digraph account_payable_process_143 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the receiving department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the receiving department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_9LNV" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"create a receiving report" -> "AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_9LNV"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_9LNV" -> "confirm all documents have been amended"
		"double check a three-way match" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_9LNV" -> "double check a three-way match"
		"AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_9LNV" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"confirm all documents have been amended" -> "AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_9LNV"
		"double check a three-way match" -> "AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_9LNV"
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_PNU4" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_9LNV" -> "AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_PNU4"
		"create voucher for the documents" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_PNU4" -> "create voucher for the documents"
		"store in paid invoice file" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_PNU4" -> "store in paid invoice file"
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_U99V" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"create voucher for the documents" -> "OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_U99V"
		"stamp all documents" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_U99V" -> "stamp all documents"
		"schedule the payment" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_U99V" -> "schedule the payment"
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" [shape=box]
		"schedule the payment" -> "enter the invoice into the accounts payable account"
		"OR_JOIN--4. Payment_U99V" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"stamp all documents" -> "OR_JOIN--4. Payment_U99V"
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" -> "OR_JOIN--4. Payment_U99V"
		"check dates to avoid penalty charges" [shape=box]
		"store in paid invoice file" -> "check dates to avoid penalty charges"
		"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_PNU4" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"OR_JOIN--4. Payment_U99V" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_PNU4"
		"check dates to avoid penalty charges" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_PNU4"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the receiving department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_PNU4" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the account payable process. It starts with sending to the receiving department. 
When sending to the receiving department is completed, you need to create a receiving report.
Once creating a receiving report occurs, the next tasks should be confirming all documents have been amended and doubling check a three-way match, they should be done in parallel. 
Once all pre-tasks are executed, then the process is split into 2 parallel branches: creating voucher for the documents and storing in paid invoice file. 
Once creating voucher for the documents occurs, one or more of the following paths should be executed: stamping all documents, scheduling the payment. 
After scheduling the payment, entering the invoice into the accounts payable account should be done. 
After storing in paid invoice file, checking dates to avoid penalty charges should be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
}
